          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Once a high-ranking **Elder** of his people, Pazuzu has been reduced to **\"breeding stock\"** and \"workforce optimization\" in the eyes of the Anunnaki.",
      "inferred": {
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "While the Anunnaki see him only as a biological unit with high utility, the other Igigi look to him for **quiet authority and wisdom**.",
