        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He is the keeper of the memory of what the Igigi were before they became \"livestock\"."
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "type": "internal_monologue",
      "text": "\"*Nature*\"",
