        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He is distinguished by a mind capable of processing complex **probability matrices** that would overwhelm most other biological species.",
