        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "While he fears the mathematical certainty of Igigi extinction, he is motivated by a desperate hope that the **indigenous biologicals** of Earth might possess the strength to resist where his own people failed.",
      "inferred": {
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "type": "internal_monologue",
      "text": "\"*Limits*\"",
      "inferred": {
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He is bound by **genetically-mandated obedience**; Anunnaki consciousness-commands bypass his ability to choose and demand immediate compliance.",
