        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Physically, he is vulnerable and lacks the defensive capacity to match the Anunnaki or their Reptilian guards."
    },
    {
      "line": 23,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His greatest limit is the **\"cold equations\"** of his own mind, which constantly tell him that survival is unlikely.",
